{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, רְשַׁם","hw":"רְשַׁם","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְשַׁם</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. inscribe, sign (</strong>𝔗 Syriac; v. BH (once, late)<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:10\" href=\"/Daniel.6.10\">Dn 6:10</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְשַׁ֫מָתָּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:13\" href=\"/Daniel.6.13\">13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְשַׁ֑מְתָּ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:14\" href=\"/Daniel.6.14\">14</a>; Impf. 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">(וְ)תִרְשֻׁם</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:9\" href=\"/Daniel.6.9\">9</a>;—<em>inscribe</em> (prob. with one’s name, i.e.) <em>sign</em>, acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּתָבָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:9\" href=\"/Daniel.6.9\">Dn 6:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:10\" href=\"/Daniel.6.10\">10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱסָר</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:13\" href=\"/Daniel.6.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:14\" href=\"/Daniel.6.14\">14</a>. <strong>Peʿîl</strong> Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְשִׁים</span>, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּתָבָא</span>: <strong>1.</strong>  <em>be inscribed, written</em>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:24\" href=\"/Daniel.5.24\">Dn 5:24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:25\" href=\"/Daniel.5.25\">25</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>be signed</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:11\" href=\"/Daniel.6.11\">6:11</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, שַׂבְּכָא","prev":"BDB Aramaic, רְפַס"}